 "bsky_posts": [
  {
   "text": "I’ve seen a lot of my colleagues’ interactions with Claude working on research problems & it would be easier for me to accept it as a serious scientific tool if it didn’t end every single response with the LLM equivalent of “you want fries with that?” — constantly trying to goad you into asking more",
   "handle": "astrokatie.com",
   "display_name": "Katie Mack",
   "likes": 2001,
   "reposts": 236,
   "replies": 51,
   "created_at": "2026-08-01T19:41:21.001Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/astrokatie.com/post/3ms27yp5ym22f",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "** As it's being discoursed:\n\nI do not use any generative AI (ChatGPT, Claude et. al.) at any stage in my writing process.\n\nI write because I enjoy writing.\n\nI enjoy the challenge of expressing an idea, or character, or setting in such short form and tell a story with them.\n\nIt's all human made.\n**",
   "handle": "microsff.com",
   "display_name": "Micro SF/F by O. Westin",
   "likes": 676,
   "reposts": 70,
   "replies": 12,
