  {
   "text": "A lot of the replies to this are writers bemoaning all the things we \"can't do\" anymore because they've become LLM tics, but I think that's a dead end. Human writers shouldn't waste our time trying to do less of any particular thing an LLM can replicate. We need to do more of the things it can't.",
